window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>A werewolf, a leprechaun, and a teenage tech genius walk into a bar...</i></b></p> <p>Sounds like a joke, right?</p> <p>Well, for Petra Graves, supernatural assassin, self-professed loner, and deadly sorcerer, that joke has just become a reality.</p> <p>When Graves is sent to a ruined castle in Poland to hunt down a rogue bloodmancer, she suddenly finds herself facing off against an enemy she can’t defeat.</p> <p>Her only option?</p> <p>To release the wild magic within and hope it doesn’t obliterate everything in its path, including her.</p> <p>That single act sets in motion a series of bizarre circumstances which rapidly complicates Petra’s simple life, surrounding her with a cadre of misfits, igniting a burgeoning romance with a two-hundred-year-old werewolf, and placing her squarely in the crosshairs of the coming apocalypse.</p> <p>Get ready, sh*t’s about to get weird!</p>"; 
